                <pb facs="0302" n="294" sameAs="frus:frus1941v03/pg294"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/15218: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Egypt</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-09-27T18:00:00-04:00">September 27, 1941—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>516. Your 1421, September 18, 4 p.m., is being considered with great care. Please
                    furnish urgently a summary statement of the principal types of wastage of
                    supplies and loss of time, traced as definitely as possible to causes.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
